#: client/src/components/admin/TokensTab.tsx
msgctxt "TokensTab, p"
msgid "Every token this village runs, and the one place any of them is named. Renaming one here renames it everywhere it appears, wallet to public pages, and no other screen carries a second box for the same name. A token's <0>slug</0> is fixed from the day it is created: history is keyed on it and is never re-denominated.<1/><2>A module's own token is listed while that module is on. Switch the module off and its token leaves this list, and every balance stays exactly where it is.</2><3/><4><5>Shown to members</5> hides a token from member-facing pages and nothing more. Balances, history and the ledger are untouched, so hiding one is reversible and takes nothing away from anybody who holds it. It does not stop a mint rule from paying. To stop issuance, pause the rule in the Mint.</4>"
msgstr "Every token this village runs, and the one place any of them is named. Renaming one here renames it everywhere it appears, wallet to public pages, and no other screen carries a second box for the same name. A token's <0>slug</0> is fixed from the day it is created: history is keyed on it and is never re-denominated.<1/><2>A module's own token is listed while that module is on. Switch the module off and its token leaves this list, and every balance stays exactly where it is.</2><3/><4><5>Shown to members</5> hides a token from member-facing pages and nothing more. Balances, history and the ledger are untouched, so hiding one is reversible and takes nothing away from anybody who holds it. It does not stop a mint rule from paying. To stop issuance, pause the rule in the Mint.</4>"

